note.p:
Not printed. The attached list of subjects, entitled “Index-Policy Briefing
                    Book,” indicates that the attachments were classified Top Secret and included
                    the following major headings (with subheadings under each): I. Africa; II.
                    American Republics; III–IV. Europe; V. Far East; VI. Near East and South Asia;
                    VII. United Nations; VIII. Economic; IX. Mutual Security Program; X.
                    Disarmament, Atomic Energy, and Outer Space; XI. Military Facilities System;
                    XII. Legislative; XIII. Information; XIV. Cultural; XV. Consular and Security;
                    XVI. Fisheries; and XVII. Visits.
